# What the image build must not receive. Without this the context the runner uploads is the
# whole of web/ -- 171MB, measured 2026-10-17, almost all of it node_modules and .next -- and
# the local node_modules then overwrites the ones `npm ci` installed inside the deps stage,
# which is how a build passes on a laptop and fails on the arm64 runner.
node_modules
.next
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
*.log
.DS_Store
tests
